@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <!-- HERO -->
        <div class="section-head">
            <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
            <h2>More Than Coffee.</h2>
            <p>
                Kopi Cinta is built on a simple belief—everyone deserves a chance,
                and connection should be accessible to all.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- INTRO VISUAL GRID -->
        <div class="hero-grid">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <span class="pill">Our Story</span>

                <h3 style="margin-top: 16px;">Where It All Began</h3>
                <p class="hero-text">
                    Kopi Cinta began with one Deaf designer who had faced many rejections.
                    When given a chance, he quickly proved that the real barrier was never
                    ability—it was access and communication.
                </p>

                <div class="about-quote">
                    “The real barrier was never ability. It was access.”
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-card">
                <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                <p>
                    To create an inclusive space where communication barriers are reduced,
                    opportunities are shared, and meaningful connections are built through
                    everyday experiences.
                </p>

                <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">Our Vision</h3>
                <p>
                    A world where differences are embraced, and everyone—regardless of ability—
                    has equal access to opportunities, growth, and community.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY TIMELINE -->
        <div class="about-timeline reveal">

            <div class="about-step">
                <div class="about-step-number">01</div>
                <div>
                    <h3>A Chance Was Given</h3>
                    <p>
                        What started with one person made us question why inclusive opportunities
                        are often kept behind the scenes.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-step">
                <div class="about-step-number">02</div>
                <div>
                    <h3>Dreams Are the Same</h3>
                    <p>
                        When we met Alif, we realized that people with disabilities do not have
                        different dreams—they just do not always get the same chances.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-step">
                <div class="about-step-number">03</div>
                <div>
                    <h3>Learning Together</h3>
                    <p>
                        Kopi Cinta became a space for training, workshops, shared experiences,
                        and growth between Deaf and hearing communities.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-step">
                <div class="about-step-number">04</div>
                <div>
                    <h3>Creating Connection</h3>
                    <p>
                        Through visual guides, gestures, and patience, communication became
                        easier and confidence grew on both sides.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- VISUAL VALUE CARDS -->
        <div class="about-values reveal">

            <div class="about-value-card">
                <span>☕</span>
                <h3>Why Coffee?</h3>
                <p>
                    Coffee is universal. It brings people together and becomes a simple bridge
                    between different worlds.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-value-card">
                <span>🤟</span>
                <h3>Why Access?</h3>
                <p>
                    Access allows people to communicate, participate, and feel included—not hidden
                    behind the scenes.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-value-card">
                <span>🤎</span>
                <h3>Why Love?</h3>
                <p>
                    Love is a universal language. At Kopi Cinta, connection matters more than
                    perfection.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- ENDING -->
        <div class="about-ending reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Our Belief</p>
            <h2>Selamanya Berbagi Cinta</h2>
            <p>
                Today, Kopi Cinta is more than a coffee shop. It is a space where Deaf and
                hearing individuals can meet, interact, and learn from each other—naturally,
                openly, and together.
            </p>
            <p class="about-signoff">
                With love,<br />
                Kopi Cinta Team
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>